e','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式开放GPT-Live-1 API，支持全双工实时语音交互功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Cursor发布Projects功能，引入协调者智能体调度数千子智能体</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic披露今年已阻止多起利用Claude模型研发生物武器的尝试</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">支付宝发布AI钱包智能体并推出Vibe Pay等三大AI收能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6fad849eb6e6e36aaa909f346a454f5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">支付宝在外滩大会宣布AI支付体系升级，推出AI钱包智能体及Vibe Pay、Skill Pay、Machine Pay三大“AI收”能力。AI钱包智能体旨在管理交易上下文，确保智能体在用户授权范围内完成支付。三大“AI收”能力则覆盖了AI应用网页变现、Skill调用计费及机器互联自动结算等场景。此外，支付宝引入蚂蚁集团自主研发的APASS商业信任基础设施，基于KYA（Know Your Agent）理念，为智能体支付提供身份核验、意图识别及全过程信任机制。目前，该技术已应用于千问AI眼镜、未来智能AI耳机及高德动量机器狗等终端，支持虹膜支付、语音缴费及自主下单等功能。蚂蚁集团CEO韩歆毅表示，AI支付正成为智能体商业的可信承诺引擎。该体系通过ACT与AMP协议，支持中国企业一次接入即可覆盖全球200多个国家和地</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">北京金融科技产业联盟发布国内首个智能体金融应用安全团体标准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/774a9e78917c81c1a9af7e1acab200d9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">北京金融科技产业联盟近日发布《智能体技术金融应用安全要求》，这是国内首个聚焦金融领域智能体应用安全的团体标准。标准明确规定，手机端第三方智能体未经金融机构授权，不得利用系统权限自动化读取或操作金融App的GUI界面。通过麦克风、截屏、录屏等权限获取数据时，必须遵守被调用方的安全策略。业内将此要求概括为“双重授权”，即智能体操作金融App须同时获得用户与机构授权。该标准由北京国家金融科技认证中心牵头，联合工行、邮储银行、华为、蚂蚁科技、火山引擎、腾讯云等机构共同制定，涵盖初始化、模型推理、身份鉴别、数据隐私及风险防控五大维度。此前，部分智能体通过模拟点击、OCR识别等方式绕过官方接口，引发账户与资金安全隐患。目前，行业已转向应用方开放接口或采用GUI-MCP协议的合规路径，如微信与荣耀推出的A2A助手能力，均需应</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式开放GPT-Live-1 API，支持全双工实时语音交互功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/295a1f84c74efe6ec793d6260326337e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI宣布正式开放GPT-Live-1 API，开发者可将ChatGPT同款实时语音能力集成至应用中，构建全双工语音助手。该模型语音前端定价为每分钟0.05美元，后台推理模型费用另计。GPT-Live-1采用全双工架构，支持边听边说，能自然处理打断、停顿及附和，显著降低交互延迟。在Full Duplex Bench测试中，其表现较GPT-Realtime-2.1提升30个百分点，并在Tau3测试中位列第一。该模型将实时交互与深度推理分离，开发者可按需选择后台模型。GPT-Live-1原生支持电话场景，提供关键词偏置、轮次检测及嘈杂环境优化，并支持更丰富的口音与语言。早期案例显示，该模型能有效减少系统主动打断，提升语音智能体交互体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Cursor发布Projects功能，引入协调者智能体调度数千子智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ac28462e70fb53f6c74eb9fb3a49d45e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI代码编辑器Cursor于9月10日正式推出Projects（beta版）功能，旨在通过“协调者智能体”调度数千个子智能体，支持大型复杂开发任务。该功能核心架构包含三大支柱：支持云端运行与本地测试以突破算力限制；通过共享系统上下文沉淀代码库理解与偏好；利用智能订阅机制监控Slack、PR等信号并主动执行任务。Projects主要应用于功能开发、大规模代码迁移及持续性维护，支持在数百个PR中逐步推进任务。官方数据显示，深度使用该功能的用户合并PR数量提升至原来的六倍。目前Projects已向所有用户逐步开放，旨在将开发者从繁琐的智能体管理中解放，实现一人指挥大规模AI智能体集群进行应用构建。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic披露今年已阻止多起利用Claude模型研发生物武器的尝试</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日披露，今年已成功阻止多起科学家利用其AI技术开展可能涉及生物武器研发的研究尝试。在已识别的五个案例中，相关行为者通过绕过管控措施及混淆研究目的等手段规避安全防护。其中一例涉及来自“不受支持地区”的研究人员，其利用Claude模型耗时数周规划禽流感相关实验，最终被Anthropic的安全过滤机制限制在性能最弱的模型上。Anthropic已封禁相关账户，但未披露研究人员所属机构及具体国家。公司指出，研发疫苗与制造生物武器所需的信息存在重叠，目前无法确定相关人员的主观恶意。此举旨在引发行业及政府对新兴生物风险的讨论。随着Mythos等先进模型发布，AI在生物学领域的潜在滥用风险引发广泛关注，专家呼吁加强对AI生物安全防护的监管，以防范恐怖组织或国家行为体利用AI制造病毒或有害病原体。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
